<title>UK: SOCCER-WALES AND IRELAND DRAW 0-0 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WALES AND IRELAND DRAW 0-0 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
